'''Thisspiasians''' were a [[Snake|serpentine]] [[species]], distinguished by their long snake-like bodies and thick [[Hair|beards]], that were [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Thisspias]]. Thisspiasians had four [[Limb|arms]], but a pair of them were often hidden beneath their [[clothing]]. Thisspiasians slept for a couple of [[Standard hour|hours]] per [[Standard day|day]], but their main form of rest was a type of trance that could last for [[Standard minute|minutes]] or hours. The trance provided neurological repair. If a Thisspiasian missed the trance, they could become emotional and irritable.<ref name="Unlimited Power" /> Thisspiasians' tails helped them slither over the rocky environment of their natural habitat and their thick beards helped deter swarms of biting [[cygnat]]s.<ref name="VE" />

The [[Jedi Master]] [[Oppo Rancisis]], who had a place in the [[Jedi High Council|Jedi Council]] during the [[Battle of Naboo]], was a Thisspiasian.<ref name="Databank" /> During the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], the Thisspiasian [[Ooris Bynar]] worked as a [[bounty hunter]].<ref name="Bounty Hunters 1">[[Bounty Hunters 1|''Bounty Hunters'' 1]]</ref> [[Codo Keburr]] was also a member of this species.<ref name="Unlimited Power" />

